  "_sText": "Since I've been bored (as usual) I decided if I can try to put an EOTech on a SCAR, so yeah this was made. This is actually my first compile so tips would be appreciated. I noticed there were smoothing errors, since I'm new to this I have no idea how to fix it. I also did a recolor on the SCAR to make it look more tan and I added a tan color on the EOTech. I'm not really sure if that's how a EOTech should look big. Anyways enjoy my first!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNo pee, wee's. I'm new to this so don't keep on asking me to make one.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font size=\"4\">UPDATE!!</font><br>\r\nAdded SevenZero's Arms<br>\r\nAdded Behemoth's Origins<br>\r\nAdded Digicamo Textures<br>\r\nNo more texture misalignment on stock (only on behemoth origins, too lazy to do it on mine)<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<font size=\"6\">I insist you to use the Digicamo texture.</font>",
